      "machineHash": "0c5af04b73c19315665e1c1d955df500aef83ad12299d43ae60e1715708099dd",
      "machineText": "\u003cstrong\u003e多視窗。\u003c/strong\u003e可在執行階段建立、管理及關閉視窗，每個視窗都有各自的設定與生命週期。",
      "status": "machine-translated",
