      "machineText": "\u003cstrong\u003e系統匣。\u003c/strong\u003e讓應用程式常駐系統匣，支援選單、亮色與暗色圖示、macOS 樣板圖示，並可選擇將視窗附加至系統匣圖示。",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "**System tray.** Give your app a persistent presence, with menus, light and dark icons, template ico…",
