      "machineHash": "432aed09b0b086de47ca5192e4cfb930dc0f7b826e3d9c9ff73ea63167f591c4",
      "machineText": "\u003cstrong\u003e原生選單與對話方塊。\u003c/strong\u003e支援各平台的應用程式選單、內容選單及原生對話方塊。",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "**Native menus and dialogs.** Application menus, context menus and native dialogs on each platform.",
