      "targetHash": "9129d507ff1b255b6a0d0903cdac92aa866801299105fab1124de35e984643ab",
      "machineHash": "9129d507ff1b255b6a0d0903cdac92aa866801299105fab1124de35e984643ab",
      "machineText": "\u003cstrong\u003e服務與產生的繫結。\u003c/strong\u003e後端仍是一般的 Go 程式碼。繫結會透過靜態原始碼分析產生，因此只需一個 `wails3 generate bindings` 命令，註解與具意義的參數名稱就能一併帶到前端。",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "**Services and generated bindings.** Your backend stays ordinary Go code. Bindings are generated wit…",
