      "targetHash": "35f5570580c3bc4736c76ae34e11a3de58b3cf7a573aaa60260d5ec4d711d2d4",
      "machineHash": "35f5570580c3bc4736c76ae34e11a3de58b3cf7a573aaa60260d5ec4d711d2d4",
      "machineText": "\u003cstrong\u003e看得見的建置系統。\u003c/strong\u003e專案採用以 [Taskfile](https://taskfile.dev) 為基礎的建置方式，讓你能檢查、擴充及偵錯，而不是依賴一個不透明的命令。",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "**A build system you can see.** Projects use a [Taskfile](https://taskfile.dev)-based build you can …",
