      "machineHash": "611a5b034a4977040a76de6ac55a72b8a3a71f6bf9245a50351bd542d490bd45",
      "machineText": "\u003cstrong\u003e應用程式內更新程式。\u003c/strong\u003e支援可插拔的提供者、密碼學驗證、不可分割的置換作業，以及可自訂佈景主題或替換的預設使用者介面。請參閱[更新程式指南](/guides/updater/)。",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "**An in-app updater.** Pluggable providers, cryptographic verification, an atomic swap and a default…",
