      "machineText": "如果你發現可重現的錯誤，請附上 `wails3 doctor` 的輸出結果與最小範例進行回報。如果想提議新功能或變更公開行為，請先建立 WEP（Wails Enhancement Proposal，Wails 增強提案）草稿 PR，而非功能要求議題。",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "If you find a reproducible bug, please report it with the output of `wails3 doctor` and a minimal ex…",
