      "machineHash": "b60429359abe94bb24cc9b31bc4ea30add2108531c6a5b442c1c51fd6cce196d",
      "machineText": "Wails v3 得以問世，要歸功於所有測試未完成版本、回報棘手錯誤、翻譯文件、回答問題及貢獻程式碼的人。謝謝你們。完整的貢獻者名單列在[致謝頁面](/credits/)上，我誠摯邀請你前往瀏覽。",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "Wails v3 exists because of the people who tested incomplete builds, reported hard bugs, translated d…",
