      "machineHash": "f5eef2549be929200ce19199afc9ef7fdecc03da61c367b68fa6f704a0f33da7",
      "machineText": "首先，要特別感謝 Wails 維護者[Atterpac](https://github.com/atterpac)。他在開發工具、Linux 桌面整合與社群支援方面的付出，協助 v3 走到今天。",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "First, a huge thank you to [Atterpac](https://github.com/atterpac), a Wails maintainer, for the deve…",
