    "b0053-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "916be5a0ed52bac4262e509d43d1cbca117c1c318f9291aaa1d97d94e68f2d58",
      "targetHash": "71f9b828c54f55c70a1b874e651b62f4216e73f648afdff50820d4bbfa2cbe4f",
      "machineHash": "71f9b828c54f55c70a1b874e651b62f4216e73f648afdff50820d4bbfa2cbe4f",
      "machineText": "也要感謝[Travis McLane](https://github.com/tmclane)早期在平台方面投入大量工作；[Stffabi](https://github.com/stffabi)奠定資產伺服器與原生平台的基礎；[Zach Botterman（popaprozac）](https://github.com/popaprozac)實作通知、Dock 整合及其他桌面功能；[Ian VanSchooten（IanVS）](https://github.com/IanVS)改善強型別事件與執行階段；以及[Lyimmi](https://github.com/Lyimmi)在 Linux 方面的工作。這些貢獻，以及每一位協助建構與完善專案的人所付出的成果，至今仍是 v3 的一部分。",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "Thank you also to [Travis McLane](https://github.com/tmclane) for his extensive early platform work;…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-25T21:46:07Z"
