      "machineHash": "ac0040fc0bae545df7833b1e787e5802e449fc0b57cde831c0740443410ce420",
      "machineText": "衷心感謝在這段漫長轉型期間一路支持 Wails 的贊助者。你們的支持讓我們有時間投入架構、工具、測試及文件工作，成就了今天的成果。也特別感謝 JetBrains 和 ZSA，以及透過程式碼審查支持本專案的[CodeRabbit](https://www.coderabbit.ai/oss)。",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "A very heartfelt thank you to the sponsors who have carried Wails through this long transition. Your…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-25T21:46:07Z"
