      "machineText": "我真的為 v3 感到自豪。我希望使用它進行開發，也能讓你感受到如同我們打造它時一樣的樂趣。試用看看、動手做些東西，並告訴我們你的想法。歡迎到 [Discord](https://discord.gg/JDdSxwjhGf)、[GitHub Discussions](https://github.com/wailsapp/wails/discussions) 或 [subreddit](https://www.reddit.com/r/wails/) 向我們打聲招呼。",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "I'm really proud of v3. I hope it gives you as much pleasure to build with as it has given us to mak…",
